@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
component "WorkItemQueryView" as View
component "WorkItemQueryViewModel" as VM
rectangle "WorkItemQuery\n- StartDate / EndDate\n- TagIds / TagFilter\n- Text / Priority\n- Limit / Offset" as Query
component "DbInterfaceBase.QueryWorkItems" as Contract
component "SQLiteDb" as SQLite
component "PgDb" as Pg
database "work_items\nwork_notes\nwork_item_tags" as Store
component "StatisticsTabData" as Statistics

User --> View : choose filters
View --> VM : QueryCommand
VM --> Query : create
VM --> Contract : query
Statistics --> Query : create tag query
Statistics --> Contract : query
Contract <|.. SQLite
Contract <|.. Pg
SQLite --> Store : parameterized SQL
Pg --> Store : parameterized SQL
Contract --> VM : ordered WorkItem list
VM --> View : results + tags

note right of Query
Tag modes:
Ignore / Any / All / None / Exact
end note
@enduml
